(82,'ChIJ_a8DDz60bjQRcxGZL0i3zUs'::text,'茶湯會西螺店'::text,'648雲林縣西螺鎮福興里中山路142-1號'::text,'雲林縣'::text,23.800096999999997::float8,120.45969199999999::float8,'OPERATIONAL'::text),
